#. translators: 1: free lookups a day, 2: lookups a day on this plan
#: includes/plan-pitch.php:287
msgid "A free account can get the phone number of %1$s workers in a day. On this plan it is %2$s. If you are ringing round twenty masons to find four who are free on Thursday, you will not be stopped halfway."
msgstr "Free account ek din te %1$s worker laka phone number lobo pare. Etu plan te %2$s ase. Brihospoti bar te khali thaka charjon bisaribole bis jon mason ke call kuri ase koile, apni adha rasta te rukhi najabo."

